WSS BRANDING GRAPHICS — SEPARATE USAGE POLICY

This file refers exclusively to:
- Wupsy-Logo-v2.png
- Wupsy-MenuBar-Icon-v1.png
- WSS_Logo.png

The separately treated graphic content and its specifically listed technical
representations are governed by ../BRANDING.md (German) and ../BRANDING.en.md
(English). The German version prevails in case of unintended substantive
translation differences. Those files accompany official distributions.

Unchanged official Wupsy applications, official DMGs and unchanged copies of the
official source repository may be redistributed with these graphics and notices.
For modified builds/forks, remove or replace the named official graphics unless
separate express permission has been obtained. This is not a blanket restriction
on MIT-licensed software, other graphics or existing third-party rights.

This policy makes no unverified claim of registered trademark status or exclusive
copyright in AI-assisted graphics. It applies only to the extent corresponding
rights exist; already granted MIT or other usage rights remain unaffected.
No originally MIT-licensed Ambient graphics are retrospectively restricted.

